      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلَاذَّا</span></b>  [<i>They</i> (a husband and his wife) <i>gave
each other pleasure,</i> or <i>delight,</i> or <i>enjoyment,</i>] on
the occasion of contact in the act of concubitus.
(A.) See also 3.

